                             let\'s verify the logic for                        
                             `count_with_bit_count`.\\nThe standard             
                             way to count numbers $< n$ with exactly            
                             $k$ set bits is:\\n- Iterate through               
                             the bits of $n$ from left to right.\\n-            
                             Maintain the number of set bits placed             
                             so far.\\n- When we encounter a \'1\'              
